# MASTER PROMPT — e-BIS Sahayak Full Product Transformation

You are working on my existing project **e-BIS Sahayak**.

This is NOT a request for a small UI cleanup.

I want you to transform the CURRENT PROJECT into a **complete, polished, production-style end-user product**.

The most important requirement is:

> **REMOVE ALL INTERNAL / DEVELOPER / SIH / DEVELOPMENT / TECHNICAL DEBUG TEXT FROM THE PUBLIC USER INTERFACE.**

The previous cleanup was insufficient. This time you MUST inspect the actual repository, trace every visible string to its source, modify the relevant files/components, run the application, inspect the rendered pages, and verify that the unwanted content is actually gone.

Do NOT simply tell me what should be changed.

**YOU MUST IMPLEMENT THE CHANGES IN THE CODEBASE.**

